WEBVTT

00:02.820 --> 00:05.320
What kind of year will this year be?

00:06.490 --> 00:10.800
It’s never been so fun to think about the future.

00:10.800 --> 00:12.980
It’s because I’m with Ayako-san.

00:13.800 --> 00:18.910
If we’re together, I’m sure only wonderful things await us.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:47.880 --> 01:49.140
MA·MO·RU！

01:53.410 --> 01:56.230
I dreamed of them again.

01:59.280 --> 02:00.360
<i>Hey.</i>

02:04.390 --> 02:06.640
<i>The power to create miracles...</i>

02:06.640 --> 02:09.740
<i>If I told you that, would you believe me?</i>

02:21.120 --> 02:22.980
<i>I still don’t have much self-confidence,</i>

02:22.980 --> 02:26.860
<i>but I think I’m getting closer to him, little-by-little.</i>

02:27.980 --> 02:29.800
It’s the new semester.

02:28.420 --> 02:31.500
3rd Semester Starts!

02:29.800 --> 02:31.500
I need to do my best.

02:31.770 --> 02:36.510
The Demon King Appears!

02:39.800 --> 02:40.510
What?

02:41.260 --> 02:41.890
Why?

02:41.260 --> 02:42.680
What?!

02:42.680 --> 02:45.620
Johan’s coming?

02:45.620 --> 02:46.540
Yes.

02:46.540 --> 02:48.070
For three days,

02:48.070 --> 02:53.240
Johan Dieter Rudiger will be a
special teacher at our school.

02:53.240 --> 02:56.330
Supposedly, this was a special
arrangement by Aldemar University.

02:56.330 --> 02:58.440
Why wouldn’t you tell me something so important?

02:58.440 --> 03:01.350
I just heard myself last night.

03:02.180 --> 03:04.900
<i>Johan Dieter Rudiger...</i>

03:04.900 --> 03:06.070
<i>The Prussian Devil.</i>

03:06.070 --> 03:08.010
<i>Emelenzia’s brother.</i>

03:08.010 --> 03:11.940
<i>And the person Ayako-san dueled.</i>

03:09.640 --> 03:12.180
The Prussian Devil Is Coming

03:12.910 --> 03:15.460
The Prussian Devil is amazing!

03:15.460 --> 03:18.810
He’s one of the world’s greatest
beatrice users.

03:18.810 --> 03:22.180
We’re lucky to get someone like that to teach us!

03:22.180 --> 03:24.090
Let’s take a picture!

03:24.090 --> 03:24.850
Wow.

03:24.850 --> 03:26.420
You guys don’t know him...

03:28.010 --> 03:31.270
But why is your brother coming to Japan?

03:31.270 --> 03:35.070
I can’t imagine it’s just to teach Beatrice Control.

03:35.070 --> 03:37.940
Witch Beatrice should know.

03:39.340 --> 03:42.550
<i>If you’ve grown into an adult woman,</i>

03:42.550 --> 03:44.470
<i>I shall come for you.</i>

03:44.470 --> 03:47.600
<i>Dry your tears and wait with anticipation</i>

03:47.600 --> 03:51.410
<i>and a fluttering heart, my bride.</i>

04:13.740 --> 04:14.940
He’s here!

04:24.850 --> 04:27.430
Brother, welcome!

04:27.430 --> 04:29.690
Witch Beatrice is here to welcome you.

04:31.630 --> 04:32.760
Yes.

04:41.040 --> 04:43.100
Johan Dieter Rudiger.

04:59.350 --> 05:01.740
You are Yoshimura Mamoru?

05:01.740 --> 05:03.740
Witch Beatrice’s lover?

05:05.410 --> 05:08.330
Yes, the person I most care for.

05:08.330 --> 05:10.980
It’s been too long, Beatrice.

05:10.980 --> 05:13.600
You’ve become yet more beautiful.

05:13.600 --> 05:15.870
You should understand.

05:15.870 --> 05:21.410
A year and a half ago, you alone were my equal.

05:21.410 --> 05:23.220
Isn’t that a bit rude?

05:23.220 --> 05:25.480
If you’re speaking to someone individually, you should...

05:25.480 --> 05:28.350
I’m the only one who can end your loneliness.

05:26.760 --> 05:27.720
Brother!

05:29.180 --> 05:33.960
I swear to eternally love and forever protect you,

05:33.960 --> 05:36.160
even at the expense of my life...

05:48.180 --> 05:49.280
Ayako-san!

05:49.280 --> 05:51.100
Yoshimura Mamoru.

05:51.890 --> 05:54.890
I’ll be watching your class.

05:54.890 --> 05:56.500
I look forward to it.

05:57.980 --> 06:02.280
You’re not worthy of Witch Beatrice.

06:08.840 --> 06:13.560
Ayako had an uncle, who was first
to recognize her beatrice talent.

06:14.350 --> 06:15.700
So cool!

06:15.700 --> 06:16.950
He’s wonderful.

06:16.950 --> 06:19.160
Did you hear that he kissed Takasu-sempai?

06:20.500 --> 06:22.810
What’s with those glasses?

06:22.810 --> 06:23.690
He’s lame!

06:23.690 --> 06:25.570
He’s lame and has lame glasses!

06:25.570 --> 06:27.890
I’m so much cooler than that jerk!

06:27.890 --> 06:29.200
That jerk!

06:32.440 --> 06:35.260
You’ve heard about her parents, right?

06:35.260 --> 06:35.880
Yes.

06:36.470 --> 06:41.190
<i>The only people in my family who can
control beatrice are my uncle and me.</i>

06:41.190 --> 06:45.220
<i>My mom and dad were jealous of my power.</i>

06:47.390 --> 06:51.230
<i>And they called me a monster.</i>

06:51.820 --> 06:54.500
He was a pillar of support to her.

06:54.500 --> 06:57.600
And now Johan has him.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.320
He went to research beatrice for what was

06:59.320 --> 07:02.440
intended to be a three month stay.
But he never came back.

07:03.100 --> 07:06.440
Ayako fought Johan to bring him back.

07:06.440 --> 07:11.860
If she won, he would return
her uncle, Takasu Masaki.

07:11.860 --> 07:13.950
Takasu Masaki...

07:19.460 --> 07:21.540
I regret it...

07:21.540 --> 07:24.630
Making them fight.

07:27.020 --> 07:30.840
At her request, I arranged the duel.

07:31.600 --> 07:35.400
As a result, even though it was a tie,
Ayako was badly hurt.

07:36.110 --> 07:38.280
Masaki never came back.

07:39.930 --> 07:42.380
Back then, I still didn’t know

07:42.380 --> 07:47.000
there was a greater beatrice user than Ayako.

07:47.000 --> 07:49.570
Someone more amazing than Ayako-san?

07:49.570 --> 07:52.620
I don’t want to feel that way again.

07:52.620 --> 07:55.490
I don’t want Ayako or you getting hurt!

07:55.490 --> 07:59.200
I don’t know what I could do
against the Prussian Devil,

07:59.200 --> 08:02.120
but... Don’t lose!

08:02.120 --> 08:05.210
You’re Ayako’s boyfriend.

08:09.300 --> 08:10.590
Ayako-san...

08:10.590 --> 08:12.160
I’m sorry about that.

08:12.840 --> 08:16.520
It wasn’t your fault! It was so sudden...

08:16.520 --> 08:20.460
I heard that he’ll be watching your class.

08:20.460 --> 08:22.290
We have class this afternoon.

08:22.290 --> 08:23.120
It’s dangerous!

08:23.120 --> 08:25.550
He’s after you!

08:25.550 --> 08:27.560
I’ll tell them to cancel the class.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.690
It’s all right.

08:28.690 --> 08:32.140
He’d do anything to accomplish his goals.

08:32.140 --> 08:33.530
If something happened to you...

08:33.530 --> 08:35.030
I can’t run from this.

08:46.170 --> 08:48.980
I’ll protect you.

08:48.980 --> 08:53.570
No, I will... I will protect you.

09:08.700 --> 09:13.530
All of you should be able to do this.

09:13.530 --> 09:15.040
Let’s begin.

09:15.860 --> 09:20.410
Focus your mind outwards, not inwards.

09:20.410 --> 09:24.340
Try to sense the beatrice around you.

09:36.050 --> 09:37.520
Mamoru-kun?

09:44.780 --> 09:46.740
<i>I can feel the beatrice.</i>

09:46.740 --> 09:47.730
<i>I can do it, too...</i>

09:55.060 --> 09:58.850
Don’t get cocky over such a feeble power.

09:58.850 --> 10:01.670
You don’t deserve to live with beatrice.

10:01.670 --> 10:04.350
You’re far too small a person.

10:04.350 --> 10:07.040
Know that first.

10:11.370 --> 10:12.500
Mamoru-kun?

10:12.500 --> 10:14.000
Yoshimura, are you OK?

10:21.440 --> 10:22.270
Mamoru!

10:33.950 --> 10:36.170
I-I’m sorry.

10:38.690 --> 10:41.450
Is something bothering you?

10:43.200 --> 10:47.160
Um, what are you going to do
with Yoshimura Mamoru?

10:48.210 --> 10:50.530
Destroy his heart.

10:50.530 --> 10:51.500
That’s all.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.600
What’s wrong?

11:03.600 --> 11:05.140
You’re sighing.

11:05.140 --> 11:08.390
Nothing. I had my first class in a while.

11:08.390 --> 11:09.850
Beatrice practice?

11:09.850 --> 11:11.720
Yeah, yeah.

11:15.880 --> 11:16.760
Hey!

11:16.760 --> 11:18.830
Itsumi!

11:18.830 --> 11:20.240
Night!

11:26.560 --> 11:29.940
<i>He cut the link between the beatrice and me.</i>

11:30.820 --> 11:35.310
<i>For him to be able to do that
without Ayako-san noticing...</i>

11:35.310 --> 11:37.340
<i>He’s amazing.</i>

11:39.060 --> 11:40.120
<i>But...</i>

11:46.680 --> 11:48.490
<i>I want to be like that person.</i>

11:48.490 --> 11:51.490
<i>Someone worthy of Ayako-san.</i>

11:53.240 --> 11:56.440
<i>So I can’t be beaten!</i>

12:01.900 --> 12:04.010
My brother is serious.

12:04.010 --> 12:05.840
He truly intends to destroy you

12:05.840 --> 12:09.210
and tear you away from the beatrice.

12:09.210 --> 12:10.210
I see.

12:10.210 --> 12:12.220
You should withdraw immediately.

12:12.220 --> 12:14.800
You cannot defeat him.

12:14.800 --> 12:15.900
I know.

12:15.900 --> 12:16.950
But...

12:18.880 --> 12:21.130
You’re going to fight?

12:22.300 --> 12:23.800
I can’t withdraw!

12:23.800 --> 12:26.630
This is my fight.

12:26.630 --> 12:31.560
I need to show Johan that
I’m Ayako-san’s boyfriend.

12:31.560 --> 12:33.740
With my own power...

12:35.010 --> 12:36.250
Mamoru.

12:37.690 --> 12:40.910
<i>I believe that’s my brother’s real...</i>

12:41.380 --> 12:42.620
Thank you.

12:42.620 --> 12:44.050
But why are you telling me?

12:44.980 --> 12:46.960
What are you saying?!

12:46.960 --> 12:48.190
Ayako-san?

12:50.620 --> 12:53.130
Right now, we’re discussing Mamoru.

12:53.130 --> 12:54.880
Don’t change the subject!

12:54.880 --> 12:56.680
Who would agree to that?

13:06.120 --> 13:07.140
Mamoru?

13:07.140 --> 13:08.870
Yoshimura Mamoru.

13:08.870 --> 13:12.980
I’m going to enjoy seeing what you do.

13:16.110 --> 13:17.350
There she is!

13:18.690 --> 13:19.950
Ayako-san!

13:20.900 --> 13:23.200
The President’s calling you.

13:23.200 --> 13:25.820
He wants you to come to the
student council room immediately.

13:28.260 --> 13:31.130
Performance

13:29.610 --> 13:31.130
A performance?

13:31.130 --> 13:33.000
With Johan and me?

13:33.000 --> 13:36.730
Yes. They’d like you and Johan

13:36.730 --> 13:39.480
to do a beatrice performance tomorrow, after school.

13:39.480 --> 13:42.450
Johan’s tenure here ends tomorrow,

13:42.450 --> 13:46.300
and some of the students would
like to see it before he goes.

13:46.300 --> 13:48.520
Johan has agreed.

13:48.520 --> 13:51.320
The teachers asked me to convince you.

13:51.320 --> 13:52.160
No.

13:52.160 --> 13:53.450
I want nothing to do with him.

13:53.450 --> 13:54.640
I’d imagine...

13:54.640 --> 13:57.050
Understood. I’ll talk to the teachers.

13:57.050 --> 14:01.230
I’d like to see Ayako-san and
Johan-san’s performance.

14:02.430 --> 14:05.060
Would you do it for me, Ayako-san?

14:20.600 --> 14:21.550
Ayako-san?

14:22.380 --> 14:23.820
Beatrice...

14:23.820 --> 14:25.320
They’re happy.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.380
The beatrice...

14:27.090 --> 14:28.450
How beautiful...

14:29.720 --> 14:33.440
This feeling... It’s the same one as before.

14:45.610 --> 14:47.740
I can’t believe it.

14:47.740 --> 14:50.400
I can’t do this...

15:24.460 --> 15:29.150
Professor Johan’s performance is about to begin.

15:29.150 --> 15:32.100
No Entry

15:29.830 --> 15:34.940
The performance will be held in
the center of the sea road.

15:34.940 --> 15:40.730
During the performance,
both monorail and vehicular traffic will halt.

15:40.730 --> 15:45.960
Please return home or visit Umihotaru at a later time.

17:56.530 --> 17:58.490
Amazing.

17:59.310 --> 18:01.230
They’re both amazing.

18:05.170 --> 18:08.420
You were wonderful, Witch Beatrice.

18:10.990 --> 18:13.980
I’m amazed, Johan. You...

18:13.980 --> 18:15.250
Ayako-san!

18:15.250 --> 18:17.030
Mamoru.

18:21.770 --> 18:23.740
I’d like to try it, too.

18:25.710 --> 18:27.350
With pleasure.

18:57.190 --> 18:59.820
Broadcasting

18:59.820 --> 19:03.490
Brother, how was my song selection?

19:04.030 --> 19:05.510
Well done.

19:57.110 --> 19:58.620
Hey, you two!

19:58.620 --> 20:01.050
Those two really are the best together.

20:11.610 --> 20:13.090
Mamoru!

20:13.090 --> 20:14.030
What’s wrong?

20:14.030 --> 20:14.730
Mamoru!

20:14.730 --> 20:15.850
What?

20:15.850 --> 20:17.170
The light’s disappearing?

20:17.170 --> 20:19.320
Yoshimura Mamoru fell over.

20:19.320 --> 20:21.990
That’s the Witch Beatrice’s boyfriend?

20:21.990 --> 20:24.360
That’s what he gets for trying to
compete with Professor Johan.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.950
I guess the professor is better match to her.

20:31.460 --> 20:33.070
I’m sorry.

20:36.890 --> 20:40.370
It’s my fault for going too far.

20:40.370 --> 20:42.030
N-No, Ayako-san—

20:42.030 --> 20:44.480
You understand, Witch Beatrice?

20:44.480 --> 20:47.960
You and he live in different worlds.

20:48.470 --> 20:51.700
I am a better match for you.

20:51.700 --> 20:55.420
Yoshimura Mamoru tried to go beyond his abilities,

20:55.420 --> 20:57.130
and collapsed.

20:57.130 --> 21:00.770
That’s all. There’s nothing to worry about.

21:00.770 --> 21:03.550
Now I’m certain that I need you.

21:04.800 --> 21:06.380
What are you trying to say?

21:06.380 --> 21:09.940
I’m currently working on a
certain research project.

21:09.940 --> 21:14.220
I’d like everyone here to understand.

21:14.220 --> 21:20.600
For that project, I’m taking
Witch Beatrice back to Germany.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
鼓動が駆け出す　キラメク想いを

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
kodou ga kakedasu kirameku omoi wo

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
君に届けにゆこう

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
kimi ni todoke ni yukou

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
夕暮れ染まった　オレンジのシャツを

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
yuugure somatta orenji no shatsu wo

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
後ろから掴む　ほらドキドキ！

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
ushiro kara tsukamu hora dokidoki

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
スリルな毎日も　楽しくいられる

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
suriru na mainichi mo tanoshiku irareru

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
君となら　うまく言えないけど　ありがとう

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
kimi to nara umaku ienai kedo arigatou

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Ｖｅｎｕｓ Ｄｒｅａｍ　秘めていた力で

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream himete ita chikara de

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
この想いがそうカタチになる

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
kono omoi ga sou katachi ni naru

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream 見つけたの　守るモノ

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream mitsuketa no mamoru mono

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
君の笑顔と思い出と

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
kimi no egao to omoide to

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.910 --> 23:15.620
Ayako-san.

23:15.620 --> 23:16.670
Ayako-san!

23:16.670 --> 23:18.230
Ayako-san...

23:18.230 --> 23:20.500
Ayako-san!

23:21.300 --> 23:23.130
What a glorious sound.

23:23.340 --> 23:24.040
Ayako-san...

23:26.260 --> 23:28.820
Just whispering it brings the goddess’s blessings down on me.

23:28.820 --> 23:31.470
The kanji for “romance” is comprised of “beneath” and “heart.”

23:31.680 --> 23:33.220
The kanji for “love” inside the heart...

23:33.350 --> 23:37.110
And the kanji for “person” has too few strokes to contain anything.

23:37.190 --> 23:39.940
Anyway, anyway, Ayako-san!

23:40.140 --> 23:43.940
Ayako’s Boyfriend
